id=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-2-5-1-1\">\n                                            Assiduidade\n                                        </span>\n                                        <span class=\"font-semibold text-[#314A4E]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-2-5-1-2\">\n                                            9/10\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"h-1 bg-[#EDF1EF] rounded-full\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-2-5-2\">\n                                        <div class=\"h-1 w-[90%] bg-[#60977E] rounded-full\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"assiduidade progress bar\" data-reason=\"width set based on criteria score\">\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mx-5 mt-3 mb-5 border-l-2 border-[#CBDACF] bg-[#FAFBFA] px-3 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[#7E8D88] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-1\">\n                                Observação do professor\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-[#526469] mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-2\">\n                                Boa leitura de jogo e colaboração na recomposição. Seguir incentivando a comunicação em quadra.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border-t border-[#EDF0F1] px-5 py-3 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-5\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[#8A9699]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-5-1\">\n                                Acompanhamento individual\n                            </span>\n                            <button class=\"text-[10px] text-[#17664B] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-5-2\">\n                                Ver histórico de Marina →\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </aside>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <footer class=\"mt-7 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 text-[10px] text-[#96A1A3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1\">\n                    Gestão Esportiva Escolar\n                    <span class=\"mx-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1-1\">\n                        ·\n                    </span>\n                    Área do professor\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2\">\n                    Dados de demonstração para o 3º bimestre de 2026\n                </span>\n            </footer>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
