er gap-2 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#485e68]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-1-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#e5a05e]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-1-1-1\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    Gabriel Rocha\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[9px] text-[#a0aaa7]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-1-2\">\n                                    Não informado\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-2\">\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#485e68]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-2-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#e5a05e]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-2-1-1\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    Helena Silva\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[9px] text-[#a0aaa7]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-2-2\">\n                                    Não informado\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-3\">\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#485e68]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-3-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#e5a05e]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-3-1-1\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    Igor Matos\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[9px] text-[#a0aaa7]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-3-3-2\">\n                                    Não informado\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f8f5] px-3 py-2.5 text-[9px] leading-[14px] text-[#74837c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-4\">\n                            “Não informado” não equivale a ausência. Cada registro é escolhido pelo professor.\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"mt-4 w-full rounded-xl bg-[#183a4d] px-4 py-3 text-[11px] font-bold text-white shadow-[0_4px_9px_rgba(21,54,72,.12)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-5\">\n                            Concluir chamada\n                            <span class=\"ml-1 text-[#c3ed92]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-5-1\">\n                                →\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2.5 text-center text-[9px] leading-[14px] text-[#9a8b78]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-1-6\">\n                            Com 3 registros em aberto, será solicitada uma confirmação.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rounded-[18px] border border-[#e7ece8] bg-[#f9fbf8] px-4 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-2-1\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-[#738778]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-2-1-1\">\n                                Também hoje\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-2 py-1 text-[9px] font-semibold text-[#83908a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-2-1-2\">\n                                3º bimestre\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#355163]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-2-2-2\">\n                            Avaliações em andamento\n                 